                                                "sense_id": "7775f42d-1710-3e0c-a1c4-fb68c68def88",
                                                "text": "This snuffbox — on the hinge see brilliants shine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de74f887-a626-4327-aa23-a5ec8f38e00b",
                                                "sense_id": "7775f42d-1710-3e0c-a1c4-fb68c68def88",
                                                "text": "On the one, a plain massive band which matched the collar; on the other, a serpent; the tail reached nearly to the elbow, and the head rose a little from the wrist; the tongue of a ruby, the eyes of large brilliants."
                                            },
                                            {
